## 第一段階
#### ハッシュテーブルの解法
```python
class Solution:
    def detectCycle(self, head: Optional[ListNode]) -> Optional[ListNode]:
        if head is None:
            return None
        
        seen = set()
        node = head

        while node is not None:
            if node in seen:
                return node
            
            seen.add(node)
            node = node.next
        
        return None
```
